  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing competitiveness through enhanced quality and compliance in the onion value chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Increasing competitiveness through enhanced quality and compliance in the onion value chain - The overall objective of the project is to Strengthen the competitiveness of The Gambia through an enhanced level of production, transformation and export capacities of the private sector in line with the regional and national industrial and SME support strategies.</narrative>
